title: "Knapsack Optimization: An Experimental Study of Classical Algorithms Under Different Problem Characteristics"
version: 2.0.0
type: software
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
authors:
  - family-names: Raj
    given-names: Risham
repository-code: "https://github.com/rishamraj-17/knapsack-benchmark"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  A reproducible empirical study comparing three classical 0/1 knapsack
  algorithms (Greedy, Dynamic Programming, Branch & Bound) across
  five Pisinger instance families, with analysis of how instance
  correlation structure and capacity scaling affects practical performance.
keywords:
  - knapsack problem
  - empirical algorithmics
  - dynamic programming
  - branch and bound
  - greedy algorithms
